{"title":"2024 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_15\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 15</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_by_MathTalks😉\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video by MathTalks😉</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(Apply_this_simple_strategy_that_works_every_time!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (Apply this simple strategy that works every time!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle_(Goes_through_full_thought_process)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle (Goes through full thought process)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_(easy_to_digest)_by_Power_Solve\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 (easy to digest) by Power Solve</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3_(2_minute_solve,_fast)_by_MegaMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3 (2 minute solve, fast) by MegaMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 4 by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_(Easy_to_understand!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_CosineMethod\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by CosineMethod</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">16</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">17</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">18</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-19\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">19</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-20\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">20</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_15\">Problem 15</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 15\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the letters <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/b/e2bbebb3bd73f1ae5c64098ab0244f739abf7ca4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$U$\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> represent distinct digits. Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/a/8ca56c9bfd7c62759b8c5e4d08af1c54279e3c53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\underline{F}~\\underline{L}~\\underline{Y}~\\underline{F}~\\underline{L}~\\underline{Y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" /> is the greatest number that satisfies the equation\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/7/047513b257239e4538e713105a012a223b79ded7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[8\\cdot\\underline{F}~\\underline{L}~\\underline{Y}~\\underline{F}~\\underline{L}~\\underline{Y}=\\underline{B}~\\underline{U}~\\underline{G}~\\underline{B}~\\underline{U}~\\underline{G}.\\]\" width=\"274\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/5/a95dfcbcaec76652ae649387381bf08beb82403f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\underline{F}~\\underline{L}~\\underline{Y}+\\underline{B}~\\underline{U}~\\underline{G}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"131\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/7/827786b899a912d2cd2bd49b1b42f5653dc56a87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1089 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 1098 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 1107 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 1116 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 1125$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"487\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/a/66ae47bb13f6e503091140e943c77780d6351da5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{FLY}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> be the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/e/7ced06740e926d74d81010ec949cff2009d75662.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100F+10L+Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"133\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Repeating a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit block twice gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/6/0c6a929762d0d916991c5d1f087d5c47683284ed.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\overline{FLYFLY}=1000\\cdot \\overline{FLY}+\\overline{FLY}=1001\\cdot \\overline{FLY}.\\]\" width=\"379\" height=\"17\" />\nSimilarly,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/a/4ca990bf4d59de29c4c3c6018c9b2dc224e03930.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\overline{BUGBUG}=1001\\cdot \\overline{BUG}.\\]\" width=\"207\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Given <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78d8051b631c417107ab6d440b898dae997f2767.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8\\cdot \\overline{FLYFLY}=\\overline{BUGBUG}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"217\" height=\"18\" />, substitute:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/8/388d4bab5cb7db32d4675a901602a7cf2a86bea6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[8(1001\\overline{FLY})=1001\\overline{BUG}.\\]\" width=\"208\" height=\"20\" />\nDivide by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/8/888c508062c09735bab7ff0e11e7dc80cc7580db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/f/43f5abba4537544cb130dc4352bf31cfd14e23b9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[8\\overline{FLY}=\\overline{BUG}.\\]\" width=\"121\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/9/a09cee19132548620f8ca12772fea9ef24701cf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BUG}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"18\" /> is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit number,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/2/4c2c7bd8c911e25e50add27a9e722902091f63b0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[100\\le 8\\overline{FLY}\\le 999 \\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad 13\\le \\overline{FLY}\\le 124.\\]\" width=\"351\" height=\"18\" />\nTo maximize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/2/f228c92271025b85ab7a5874aebee529cf04ea0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{FLYFLY}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"18\" />, maximize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/a/66ae47bb13f6e503091140e943c77780d6351da5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{FLY}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Try the largest possible value:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/0/e303811361604b5800ca8639e9df87363e03687d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\overline{FLY}=123 \\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad \\overline{BUG}=8\\cdot 123=984.\\]\" width=\"326\" height=\"16\" />\nThe digits <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/b/c0b0fcf6d2246e8e69f670925951aab056fed57b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1,2,3,9,8,4\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"115\" height=\"20\" /> are all distinct, so this works and is maximal.\n</p><p>Therefore,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/e/0fed0a9c5c4a28a5eb0e5f75efe04eed72824ca9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\overline{FLY}+\\overline{BUG}=123+984=1107.\\]\" width=\"272\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/b/89bd22556d86f12dbd1d25d5823a6161ca2e9742.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{1107}\\]\" width=\"48\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~ Shreyan of Winston Churchill Middle School\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The divisibility rule for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is that the last <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> digits need to be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. That means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/b/4db9845d9cfee04f6d0fc8b09d70aec25ea045fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BUG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> needs to be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> with distinct digits. And since multiplying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/1/3b13575240707fbbaf3a787959260dd6f8c7d293.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FLY$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/b/4db9845d9cfee04f6d0fc8b09d70aec25ea045fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BUG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, we know that the number needs to be a product of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> digit number. From the more foundational multiplication facts, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/4/b84ec66bb4d37fd7138c090d30a51c0f3e1f691e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$125\\cdot 8 = 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"112\" height=\"14\" />. Moving down from there, we can try <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/5/c15ae307f130b29aa60cb2bba094ea657b87a903.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$124 * 8 = 992$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"107\" height=\"14\" />. This won't work because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/1/091ec049f398072466aa0ac632ca614dda4e26c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$992$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> does not have distinct digits. Next, we can try <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/3/e13c782cdf2d7509f7811fe74fd3ad0881eb45a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$123 * 8 = 984$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"107\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/e/5de435f5a43db8d04b8f071c573d8d7d78ef355a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 2, 3, 9, 8,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are all distinct digits. That means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/e/0aead4cdfaf1678232cef9cbdef73a47031c9b60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FLY = 123$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"95\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/7/6172f95087d1879fe3a3b60cbe4e656fc8fddbe3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BUG = 984$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"97\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/c/e8cbdac7bf92d5fff7613f3025f8bd46eda9ce71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$123 + 984 = 1107$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"139\" height=\"15\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/a/2aa484827e164c18f5af8faf8fcb1a351b269c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />. Note that while guessing and checking multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> sounds like an unreliable strategy, we know that the number needs to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/1/5e183dd3a1455f5c034d3cf7514f1aa7befe3eab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8\\cdot FLYFLY$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"106\" height=\"14\" />, which would for certain be a large number. \n</p><p>-mathdragonmochi\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/qJqrFauo3lQ\">https://youtu.be/qJqrFauo3lQ</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/TMTTu6kfwqE\">https://youtu.be/TMTTu6kfwqE</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_by_MathTalks.F0.9F.98.89\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_by_MathTalks😉\">Video by MathTalks😉</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video by MathTalks😉\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/qAwRUj2N46c?si=QDUY8ZUVFP29Eg4c\">https://youtu.be/qAwRUj2N46c?si=QDUY8ZUVFP29Eg4c</a>\n</p>\n<pre>~rc1219\n</pre>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_.28Apply_this_simple_strategy_that_works_every_time.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(Apply_this_simple_strategy_that_works_every_time!!!)\">Video Solution by Math-X (Apply this simple strategy that works every time!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math-X (Apply this simple strategy that works every time!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/BaE00H2SHQM?si=8CKIFksKvhOWABN3&amp;t=3485\">https://youtu.be/BaE00H2SHQM?si=8CKIFksKvhOWABN3&amp;t=3485</a>\n</p><p>~MATH-x\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle_.28Goes_through_full_thought_process.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle_(Goes_through_full_thought_process)\">Video Solution 